<b>V2.32.0 Release</b>

<i><b>Upgrade Notes</b></i>

* Requires NSP V1.44.0 or newer.

<i><b>Features</b></i>

* Added new <b>Vehicle Functions</b>
	* Thermofan
	* Windscreen Washer and Wipers

* Added <b>Vehicle Functions - Service Indicator</b> to track when a service is due. Services can be based on distance or time.

* Added <b>Vehicle Functions - Hour Meter</b> to track how many hours have occured under a set of conditions.
    * Useful to track how long an engine, transmission, or other vehicle component has run for.

* Added support for <b>Day and Night Opacity</b> for <b>Image components</b>.

* Added four new bar gauges that support <b>Value Text</b> alignment, <b> Reversing Bar direction</b>,<b>Step Size</b> and <b> Bars per step</b>
	* Bar Horizontal Segmented
	* Bar Horizontal Continuous
	* Bar Vertical Segmented
	* Bar Vertical Continuous

* Added <b>Brake Pedal</b> Sensor.

* Bar Horizontal 2 component supports  <b> Reversing Bar direction</b>

<i><b>Changes</b></i>

* Improved support for <b>OBDII</b> CAN protocol.

* Added <b>Sensors - Park Switch</b>.
    * When NOT using the <i>Selector Position</i> function, if the Park Switch is activated, then the gear will be park.

* Changed <b>Drive Shaft RPM Sensor - Number of Teeth</b> to <b>Drive Shaft RPM Sensor - Pulses Per Revolution</b>. Values can now be entered with 2 decimal places, but otherwise works the same as before.
    * This allows support of drivetrain sensors which are connected to the driveshaft through a gear set, resulting in a ratio.

* Added support for specifying custom wire colors.

* Within <i>Generics</i> in the navigation tree, added sub-nodes to group the generics of each type.

<b>Fixes</b>

* Fixes the last tick mark on dial gauges sometimes not displaying correctly

* Fixed the individual tyre leak channels, <b>Front Left Tyre Air Leak Detected</b>, <b>Front Right Tyre Air Leak Detected</b>, <b>Rear Left Tyre Air Leak Detected</b>, and <b>Rear Right Tyre Air Leak Detected</b> not displaying correctly when the TMS-4 is enabled on the dash.

* Fixes <b>Nitrous Stage X Output</b> channel sometimes not changing state

* Allow a maximum value of more than 400km/h for all vehicle speed channels.

* Replaced default font

* Limits the SPI/DPI maximum frequency to 5 KHz.

* Changes the dependency from <b>Throttle Position</b> to <b>Engine Demand</b> for the Air Conditioning System.

* Fixs the screen background colour sometimes not applied to DigitalMatrix screen

* Fixes <b>Font Size 0 invalid value</b> error message while upgrading

* For OBDII protocol:
    * Channels will show "Time Out" in case of network disruption,
    * Dash will go into bus recovery mode and retries querying the data.
